{"title":"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/3/8437e1b1294378b7f0a667ffc66215648662ec71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p &gt; 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" /> is a prime number and\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/b/a3b8f0ef8c437e7ee236fb9b5b8f3ffbacf93c2a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S = \\sum_{2 \\le i &lt; j &lt; k \\le p-1} ijk\\]\" width=\"153\" height=\"40\" />\nProve that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/0/8f0cd31d4f9286e15e327c22a45269273c01b1e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"42\" height=\"14\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>if you let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/2/8122aa89ea6e80784c6513d22787ad86e36ad0cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"10\" height=\"17\" /> be constant, you can think of it as summing for each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/5/7f598c4736762c29e093bb0862f294883c478e79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum^{p-1}_{k=j+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -26px\" width=\"42\" height=\"59\" />, and since its for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" /> you can add another sum to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/2/262027f83621d8c8749ab18193a54acf87d7bd22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum^{j-1}_{i=2}\\sum^{p-1}_{k=j+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -26px\" width=\"71\" height=\"59\" />, and for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/2/8122aa89ea6e80784c6513d22787ad86e36ad0cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"10\" height=\"17\" /> we can add another sum, to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/2/162fc4bbcb1d710fde6f5ee59cd2551800a32c2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{2\\leq i&lt;j&lt;k\\le p-1}ijk=\\sum^{p-2}_{j=2}\\sum^{j-1}_{i=2}\\sum^{p-1}_{k=j+1}ijk$\" style=\"vertical-align: -26px\" width=\"270\" height=\"59\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34e8fffe549173ed11175253b334cf1b81d0e187.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum^{p-2}_{j=2}\\sum^{j-1}_{i=2}\\sum^{p-1}_{k=j+1}ijk\\]\" width=\"125\" height=\"54\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/9/c59473f1c7f35934ee20bf96cc34f0f2aae8e40a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum^{p-2}_{j=2}\\sum^{j-1}_{i=2}ij\\sum^{p-1}_{k=j+1}k\\]\" width=\"128\" height=\"54\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/2/6c2108fe916dc0e5043be9e6ecd00e54441a7ea9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum^{p-2}_{j=2}\\sum^{j-1}_{i=2}ij\\left(\\frac{(p-j-1)(p+j)}{2}\\right)\\]\" width=\"240\" height=\"54\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/6/2d6f722ba7c626d846a9328164230b3f9486e673.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{2}\\sum^{p-2}_{j=2}\\sum^{j-1}_{i=2}i(j(p-j-1)(p+j))\\]\" width=\"238\" height=\"54\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/4/1c487aaed7b50d8a981c0f7ac2a654c9730dd4e7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{2}\\sum^{p-2}_{j=2}\\frac{(j+1)(j-2)(j(p-j-1)(p+j))}{2}\\]\" width=\"315\" height=\"53\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/1/3c17cec8340ae8e9d06dc944de7849b3c99f0123.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{4}\\sum^{p-2}_{j=2}(j+1)(j-2)(j(p-j-1)(p+j))\\]\" width=\"308\" height=\"53\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/e/ffe73f35be291bc9477ebe3a53a0fb632f32ecf2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{4}\\sum^{p-2}_{j=2}-j^5+j^3p^2-j^3p+3j^3-j^2p^2+j^2p+2j^2-2jp^2+2jp\\]\" width=\"477\" height=\"53\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/1/8c1126412259f1e7d13bfcc9b051fcddcc30755a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{4}(\\sum^{p-2}_{j=2}-j^5+(p^2-p+3)\\sum^{p-2}_{j=2}j^3+(-p^2+p+2)\\sum^{p-2}_{j=2}j^2-(2p^2-2p)\\sum^{p-2}_{j=2}j)\\]\" width=\"536\" height=\"53\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/6/44675e74f815ba9a6e272214afa674eb2bdcbfde.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{4}(-\\frac{2n^6+6n^5+5n^4-n^2}{12}+(p^2-p+3)\\frac{(p-2)^2(p-1)^2}{4}-(p^2-p+3)+(-p^2+p+2)\\frac{(p-2)(p-1)(2p-1)}{6}+(p^2-p-2)-(2p^2-2p)\\frac{(p-1)(p-2)}{2}+(2p^2-2p)\\]\" width=\"1172\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/9/9697852dd3e12aadade511782709f2d7b16fa668.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{48}(p^6-7p^5+11p^4+3p^3+12p^2-20p-48)=S\\]\" width=\"387\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/a/9ca07b09d30f106bf03c2ca59cec150e8edbec8d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S+1=\\frac{1}{48}(p^6-7p^5+11p^4+3p^3+12p^2-20p-48)+1=\\frac{p}{48}(p^5-7p^4+11p^3+3p^2+12p-20)\\]\" width=\"664\" height=\"37\" />\nsince it has a factor pf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, we need to prove <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/f/43f9c0a86556eb7ad160aa1e237202d3330e7630.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{p^5-7p^4+11p^3+3p^2+12p-20}{48}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"265\" height=\"41\" /> is always an integer, for prime <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/4/4843d240c7b2c54b45cfc9ed28b13887dfd36adb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p&gt;3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/2/5923cf87ea096cc7bbe1d370cab88c96b698c154.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\mod 6\\equiv 1\\text{ or }5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"141\" height=\"18\" />, so let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/e/8be8192104daba912a0bed35ab90bdfe33b3b254.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=6k+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/f/67fda274b5e2db6d453c0357c2ba890a58cd533f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=6k+5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />\nfor the first case, you get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/4/3b4b76698692c6f0818084e49ab95de7c8d3f9c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{24k(324k^4+108k^3-63k^2+6k+7)}{48}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"290\" height=\"41\" /> and for the second you get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/a/7dac740cc4723f3c0a86c68d5894a2181c1bad7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{24(3k+2)(108k^4+252k^3+195k^2+54k+5)}{48}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"363\" height=\"41\" />, notice how both of these are always integers, thus it is proven <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/0/8f0cd31d4f9286e15e327c22a45269273c01b1e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"42\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO\">2013 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017155827\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 198/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1044/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 52/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6452/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.587      1 Template:Indonesia_MO_box\n100.00%   12.587      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:30323:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017155827 and revision id 237800. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}